# Fix user-visible problems within scope

Fix reported failures at realistic usage sizes, including background tabs,
casting, picture in picture, Now Playing and protected video. Rarity is not a
reason to leave a defect. Synthetic stress sizes alone do not expand scope.
Describe what the user sees or hears; distinguish confirmed causes from
hypotheses. Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#complete-and-verify-the-assigned-work).
